📌 Architecture Layers

1. Presentation Layer (Frontend)
-Student Dashboard
-Warden Dashboard
-Supervisor Dashboard
-Security Dashboard
-Login & Authentication Pages
-QR Scanner Interface
-Complaint Forms
-Visitor Registration
-Announcements


2. Application Layer (Backend)
Developed using Python Flask.
Handles:

-User Authentication
-Role-Based Access Control (RBAC)
-Complaint Processing
-Leave/Gate Pass Approval
-Visitor Approval
-QR Generation & Validation
-Emergency SOS
-Dashboard Data
-Report Generation



3. Database Layer
  Stores:
-Student Details
-Hostel Rooms
-Complaint Records
-Visitor Records
-Gate Pass Records
-User Accounts
-QR Tokens
-Notifications
-Announcements


4. External Services
-QR Code Generator
-QR Code Scanner
-Email Notifications (Future)
-SMS Alerts (Future)
